{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Near-Mage is a story-driven adventure game where curiosity, exploration, and atmosphere take center stage.<strong></strong>You play as an aspiring mage arriving in Transylvania, attend a magic school, learn spells, and slowly uncover the hidden stories of the people who live there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685870/extras/35066365ab3d3b86047a1b6b4ad7cc75.poster.avif?t=1767972779\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685870/extras/35066365ab3d3b86047a1b6b4ad7cc75.webm?t=1767972779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685870/extras/35066365ab3d3b86047a1b6b4ad7cc75.mp4?t=1767972779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study spell crafting in the Transylvanian Institute for Magick as a Near-Mage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own spell inventory, use it with different results in every play-through</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through a structured, story-driven journey while freely choosing the classes you take, the spells you learn, and how and when you cast them, shaping the world around you for better or worse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 3 different realms inspired by Transylvanian architecture, myths, and landscapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of quirky, memorable characters, each with their own secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a deep and engaging story that plays like an adventure game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685870/extras/ff62cf70342eee2e633218595b39ac92.poster.avif?t=1767972779\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685870/extras/ff62cf70342eee2e633218595b39ac92.webm?t=1767972779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685870/extras/ff62cf70342eee2e633218595b39ac92.mp4?t=1767972779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're <strong>Illy Vraja</strong>, a teenager at a crossroads in her life who gets invited to Transylvania by her mysterious Great-Aunt, Domnica, only to find out she comes from a long line of witches, and is entitled to enroll in the Transylvanian Institute for Magick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685870/extras/68ccebba68a78384783afd487e18b920.poster.avif?t=1767972779\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685870/extras/68ccebba68a78384783afd487e18b920.webm?t=1767972779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685870/extras/68ccebba68a78384783afd487e18b920.mp4?t=1767972779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Near-Mage, you are entering a summer preparatory school, hoping to graduate into a full-fledged spell caster. You\u2019ll take classes in different types of Magick and see how you can <strong>use your growing powers to affect the lives of those you come across</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685870/extras/92fff61463686e997250ee4be2f6b253.avif?t=1767972779\" width=600 height=251 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are from Transylvania, Romania ourselves, so we\u2019re doing a deep dive into its rich lore, legends and superstitions, heavily drawing on them in creating Near-Mage\u2019s dark and colorful world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel freely between three main hubs: the real-life town of Sighi\u0219oara, the mythical town of Rakus, that lies beyond a Magickal veil and cannot be seen by most, and the <strong>Transylvanian Institute for Magick</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Near-Mage will allow for a lot of freedom when approaching the situations you\u2019ll encounter within the Transylvanian Institute for Magick and its surroundings.  When it comes to spell-crafting, you can choose what type of classes you\u2019re taking on a whim, or you can look up recipes in a spellbook and strategize your build. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685870/extras/097a42422204892085363358cf047553.avif?t=1767972779\" width=600 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This build variety will in turn lead to different outcomes for some quest lines, affect certain NPCs\u2019 fates, and result in high replayability. Maybe you\u2019ve erased an NPC\u2019s memory on your first play-through.  What if you used a different spell on them this time around\u2026 or no spell at all? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll be able to play Near-Mage as a point and click, or you can control the character directly. Walk to your objectives, run at full speed, or even fly there!<br><strong><br>Designed for Players Who Enjoy</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven adventure with a clear narrative arc</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy, relaxing experiences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted worlds\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic Transylvanian folklore &amp; locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Games that value mood, art, and storytelling\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685870/extras/c55819c42aafcc0b4cab8fb65157ffb0.poster.avif?t=1767972779\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685870/extras/c55819c42aafcc0b4cab8fb65157ffb0.webm?t=1767972779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685870/extras/c55819c42aafcc0b4cab8fb65157ffb0.mp4?t=1767972779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make friends or enemies with fellow students, learn to be closer to your Magickal calling, and lift the veil off of ancient mysteries in Near-Mage!</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"So fresh, so clean","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1685870/e97a8f6d50e208664b2ccb71aa787a49fca0b490.jpg"},{"name":"My own summer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1685870/b9650d9571d3ae2075f9c85bdb6c648187caffce.jpg"},{"name":"Into the unknown","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1685870/10e8064e47a40e366a2575510b4b8f3f12af7b27.jpg"},{"name":"We're in this together","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1685870/1e1288488bfb0f1bde81ecd460017e6adce21590.jpg"},{"name":"People can fly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1685870/72c6d2d6cda278a64639ffb089aedaa722f42395.jpg"},{"name":"She's crafty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1685870/22d38495a4b94bb9a2f3fd02070761db0474617a.jpg"},{"name":"A new momentum","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1685870/a840c95d9d9086c8a9bf2747d1fdecf21ea89961.jpg"},{"name":"Head like a hole","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1685870/edba30a191a59f08b6294e69d9ead0ca12ee1348.jpg"},{"name":"Raining blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1685870/0aac918fefc3c7bfd122ccc08adcd1e833223de6.jpg"},{"name":"Light my fire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1685870/89325b6dcce82741ac9d6c1950341b2f921bf211.jpg"}],"total":54},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1685870?t=1767972779","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685870/e8511a9094471f5e4d08c8eb6e1f6c0df3ab9e8f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767972779","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685870/5293a7df9a7c3280cdaf9ff281440cf50e0279fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767972779","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685870/5293a7df9a7c3280cdaf9ff281440cf50e0279fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767972779","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Near-Mage will contain mild swearing and some sexual innuendo, alcohol and tobacco consumption, cartoon violence, and rare representations of dead bodies."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Near-Mage is a story-driven adventure game where curiosity, exploration, and atmosphere take center stage.<strong></strong>You play as an aspiring mage arriving in Transylvania, attend a magic school, learn spells, and slowly uncover the hidden stories of the people who live there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685870/extras/35066365ab3d3b86047a1b6b4ad7cc75.poster.avif?t=1767972779\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685870/extras/35066365ab3d3b86047a1b6b4ad7cc75.webm?t=1767972779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685870/extras/35066365ab3d3b86047a1b6b4ad7cc75.mp4?t=1767972779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study spell crafting in the Transylvanian Institute for Magick as a Near-Mage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own spell inventory, use it with different results in every play-through</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through a structured, story-driven journey while freely choosing the classes you take, the spells you learn, and how and when you cast them, shaping the world around you for better or worse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 3 different realms inspired by Transylvanian architecture, myths, and landscapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of quirky, memorable characters, each with their own secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a deep and engaging story that plays like an adventure game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685870/extras/ff62cf70342eee2e633218595b39ac92.poster.avif?t=1767972779\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685870/extras/ff62cf70342eee2e633218595b39ac92.webm?t=1767972779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685870/extras/ff62cf70342eee2e633218595b39ac92.mp4?t=1767972779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're <strong>Illy Vraja</strong>, a teenager at a crossroads in her life who gets invited to Transylvania by her mysterious Great-Aunt, Domnica, only to find out she comes from a long line of witches, and is entitled to enroll in the Transylvanian Institute for Magick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685870/extras/68ccebba68a78384783afd487e18b920.poster.avif?t=1767972779\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685870/extras/68ccebba68a78384783afd487e18b920.webm?t=1767972779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685870/extras/68ccebba68a78384783afd487e18b920.mp4?t=1767972779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Near-Mage, you are entering a summer preparatory school, hoping to graduate into a full-fledged spell caster. You\u2019ll take classes in different types of Magick and see how you can <strong>use your growing powers to affect the lives of those you come across</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685870/extras/92fff61463686e997250ee4be2f6b253.avif?t=1767972779\" width=600 height=251 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are from Transylvania, Romania ourselves, so we\u2019re doing a deep dive into its rich lore, legends and superstitions, heavily drawing on them in creating Near-Mage\u2019s dark and colorful world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel freely between three main hubs: the real-life town of Sighi\u0219oara, the mythical town of Rakus, that lies beyond a Magickal veil and cannot be seen by most, and the <strong>Transylvanian Institute for Magick</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Near-Mage will allow for a lot of freedom when approaching the situations you\u2019ll encounter within the Transylvanian Institute for Magick and its surroundings.  When it comes to spell-crafting, you can choose what type of classes you\u2019re taking on a whim, or you can look up recipes in a spellbook and strategize your build. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685870/extras/097a42422204892085363358cf047553.avif?t=1767972779\" width=600 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This build variety will in turn lead to different outcomes for some quest lines, affect certain NPCs\u2019 fates, and result in high replayability. Maybe you\u2019ve erased an NPC\u2019s memory on your first play-through.  What if you used a different spell on them this time around\u2026 or no spell at all? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll be able to play Near-Mage as a point and click, or you can control the character directly. Walk to your objectives, run at full speed, or even fly there!<br><strong><br>Designed for Players Who Enjoy</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven adventure with a clear narrative arc</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy, relaxing experiences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted worlds\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic Transylvanian folklore &amp; locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Games that value mood, art, and storytelling\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685870/extras/c55819c42aafcc0b4cab8fb65157ffb0.poster.avif?t=1767972779\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685870/extras/c55819c42aafcc0b4cab8fb65157ffb0.webm?t=1767972779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685870/extras/c55819c42aafcc0b4cab8fb65157ffb0.mp4?t=1767972779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make friends or enemies with fellow students, learn to be closer to your Magickal calling, and lift the veil off of ancient mysteries in Near-Mage!</strong></p>","developers":["Stuck In Attic"],"dlc":[3747230,3748670,3758390],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685870/e1bb5c15bca76d02d63ce67c1bd9a0c7cf6ddaa8/header.jpg?t=1767972779","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04, Ubuntu 18.04, and CentOS 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5 GHz Intel Core i3 or equivalent with multithreading<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 3000<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04, Ubuntu 18.04, and CentOS 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-3470, 3.20GHz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> High Sierra 10.13+<br></li><li><s